	I've been reading these news letters for about a month now and I always
see people trying to change the game by adding millions of things.  Does anyone
out there ever use any of these ideas???  I can understand why people would
want to make the game more interesting but I've never seen anyone post a
message saying they would use someones ideas.  Everyone seems to be caught up
on this polypiling trick, which I think makes the character WAY to powerful, so
why doesn't someone just change the game and give each item a saving throw
every time it is polymorphed???  Sounds simple enough.  We have to make saving
throws every time we ourselves polymorph.  Why not have items and pets make
saving throws too?  It just seems like such an easy answer to such a talked
about problem.


